The files in this folder (windows, splits and protocol lists) are derived from the MMAUD dataset
(Yuan et al., "MMAUD: A Comprehensive Multi-Modal Anti-UAV Dataset for Modern Miniature Drone
Threats", ICRA 2024, doi:10.1109/ICRA57147.2024.10610957), which is released under the
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence.

Accordingly, these files are released under the same licence, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

The code in this repository is MIT licensed (see ../LICENSE).
